1
00:00:04,259 --> 00:00:06,259
(Leonard:)You know,
I'm happy that Penny's moving on.

2
00:00:06,428 --> 00:00:08,258
It gives me freedom to move on myself.

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:11,600
(Howard:)Are you saying
that you've been holding back?

4
00:00:12,475 --> 00:00:14,975
(Leonard:)Of course. Out of respect.

5
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:19,275
(Howard:)So how do you explain
the 10 years before Penny?

6
00:00:20,066 --> 00:00:22,316
(Raj:)Who were you respecting then?

7
00:00:22,777 --> 00:00:25,067
(Leonard:)What? I've dated plenty of women.

8
00:00:25,238 --> 00:00:29,448
There was, uh, Joyce Kim,
Leslie Winkle...

9
00:00:30,952 --> 00:00:33,412
(Sheldon:)Notify the editors
of the Oxford English Dictionary:

10
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:36,620
The word "plenty"
has been redefined to mean "two."

11
00:00:38,877 --> 00:00:40,877
(Leonard:)What about that girl last year
at Comic-Con?

12
00:00:41,046 --> 00:00:42,716
- It doesn't count.
- Why not?

13
00:00:42,881 --> 00:00:46,631
(Raj:)What happens in costume at Comic-Con
stays at Comic-Con.

14
00:00:46,968 --> 00:00:49,218
(Howard:)You're only saying that
because of what happened.

15
00:00:49,387 --> 00:00:51,847
- What happened to you?
- Nothing happened to me.

16
00:00:52,224 --> 00:00:53,474
(Howard:)It wasn't your fault, Raj.

17
00:00:53,642 --> 00:00:56,892
(Howard:)He was dressed
as a green Orion slave girl.

18
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:01,020
How did we get on me?
We were mocking Leonard.

